          %h3#in_1category_theory In 1-category theory
          %p
            Discussion in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/1-category"} 1-
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category+theory"} category theory
          %h4#ordinary_pasting_law Ordinary pasting law
          %p Statements of the pasting law in textbooks, typically leaving the proof to the reader:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Saunders+MacLane"}> Saunders MacLane
                , Ex. 8 on p. 72 in:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Categories+for+the+Working+Mathematician"} Categories for the Working Mathematician
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://link.springer.com/book/10.1007/978-1-4757-4721-8"} doi:10.1007/978-1-4757-4721-8
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jiri+Adamek"}> Jiri Adamek
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Horst+Herrlich"} Horst Herrlich
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/George+Strecker"} George Strecker
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Abstract+and+Concrete+Categories"} Abstract and Concrete Categories
                %strong 17
                (2006) 1-507 (
                %a{:href => "http://www.tac.mta.ca/tac/reprints/articles/17/tr17abs.html"}> tac:tr17
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "http://katmat.math.uni-bremen.de/acc/"} book webpage
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://katmat.math.uni-bremen.de/acc/acc.pdf"} pdf
          %p A proof is spelled out in:
          %ul
            %li#Bauer12
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andrej+Bauer"}> Andrej Bauer
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em The pullback lemma in gory detail
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "http://math.andrej.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/05/pullback.pdf"} pdf
              = succeed ")" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Bauer_PullbackLemma.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
          %h4#reverse_pasting_law_2 Reverse pasting law
          %p The reverse pasting law is discussed in:
          %ul
            %li{:id => "CarboniJanelidzeKellyParé97"}
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Aurelio+Carboni"}> Aurelio Carboni
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/George+Janelidze"} George Janelidze
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Max+Kelly"} Max Kelly
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Robert+Par%C3%A9"} Robert Paré
                = succeed "," do
                  %em On localization and stabilization for factorization systems
                %strong 5
                (1997) 1-58 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1023/A:1008620404444"}> doi:10.1023/A:1008620404444
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li#GarnerLack12
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Richard+Garner"}> Richard Garner
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Steve+Lack"} Steve Lack
                = succeed "," do
                  %em On the axioms for adhesive and quasiadhesive categories
                %strong 27
                3 (2012) 27-46 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1108.2934"}> arXiv:1108.2934
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.tac.mta.ca/tac/volumes/27/3/27-03abs.html"} tac:27-03
            %li#Gran21
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Marino+Gran"}> Marino Gran
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em An introduction to regular categories
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2004.08964"} arXiv:2004.08964
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://www.springerprofessional.de/en/new-perspectives-in-algebra-topology-and-categories/19764096"} ISBN:978-3-030-84319-9
            %li#Przybylek13
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michal+Przybylek"}> Michal Przybylek
                ,
                %em The other pullback lemma
                (2013) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1311.2974"}> arXiv:1311.2974
                \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            cf.
            %a{:href => "https://mathoverflow.net/q/143070/381"} MO:143070
          %h3#in_model_category_theory In model category theory
          %p
            Discussion in
